    <string name="stock_help_btn">How do I go back?</string>
    <string name="stock_none">There is no other home screen enabled to open.</string>
    <string name="stock_help">Easiest: in this menu choose "Stop it being the home screen".\n\nIf the app will not open: Settings → Accessibility → Magiic TV → switch off.\n\nTo remove it completely: Settings → Apps → Magiic TV → Uninstall. In every case the original Google TV home screen comes back by itself.</string>
